OL,3,GNEWSATV star's brother 'never
OL,4,Arecovered' from her death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe brother of TV presenter Caroline
OL,7,FFlack took his own life having "never
OL,8,Frecovered" after his sister's death, an
OL,9,Finquest heard.
OL,11,FPaul Flack, 55, was found unresponsive
OL,12,Fat his home in Sandringham Road,
OL,13,FNorwich, on 21 June, and died later in
OL,14,Fhospital.
OL,16,FHis partner told Norfolk Coroner's
OL,17,FCourt how he had struggled with his
OL,18,Ffather developing dementia and his
OL,19,Fyounger sister's death in 2020.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
